[hypothesis] On the most-liquid crypto major, the 21:00–23:00 UTC hours carry Bitcoin's economically significant intraday drift (post-equity-close, US-aligned re-entry into thinner books); conditioning entry on a positive, volatility-scaled intraday-momentum signal measured 00:00→21:00 selects the days where that window's conditional mean clears the 0.30% round trip — falsified if a 2026 equity curve of ~25–40 such window trades drifts down rather than up.
