[hypothesis] On the most-liquid crypto major, when the weekend leaves spot trading below the Friday CME-futures close (a gap-down) inside an uptrend, price reverts UP to fill that reference level far more often than it runs the stop; buying the confirmed turn and exiting at the fill earns well above 0.30%/round-trip. False if 2026 gap-down entries reach the Friday reference less often than they hit the stop, or if the net of fills minus stops+costs is <=0.
